{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBarline\/id","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"title":"id","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL10MXLBarlineV2idSSSgvp","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBarline"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlbarline\/id"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The optional-unique-id attribute group allows an element to optionally specify an ID that is unique to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specifies an id reference."}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLBarline":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLBarline","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"If a barline is other than a normal single barline, it should be represented by a barline type that describes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it. This includes information about repeats and multiple endings, as well as line style. Barline data is on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same level as the other musical data in a score — a child of a measure in a partwise score, or a part in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timewise score. This allows for barlines within measures, as in dotted barlines that subdivide measures in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"complex meters. The two fermata elements allow for fermatas on both sides of the barline (the lower one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inverted).","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLBarline","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBarline","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlbarline","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLBarline","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLBarline/id":{"kind":"symbol","title":"id","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlbarline\/id","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLBarline\/id","abstract":[{"text":"The optional-unique-id attribute group allows an element to optionally specify an ID that is unique to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specifies an id reference.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"}}}